  "description": "Falsely accused of treason and cast out from his noble lineage, Do-hwa finds himself with nowhere to turn—except to his childhood friend, Sung-mook. To protect him, Sung-mook offers shelter...by disguising Do-hwa as his personal concubine. But the ruse doesn’t end with just makeup and dresses. To keep up appearances, Sung-mook insists Do-hwa serve him in the bedroom, too. What starts as merely an act turns into something far more complicated...and far more intimate. For when desire and deception collide, who’s really in control? \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
